   "text": "14 October 2026, Sun Prairie, Wisconsin: Walmart staff on McCoy Road reported an active theft; the suspect fled on foot and officers caught him in a backyard after a chase. Narration: 'He ran. Police caught him in a backyard.'",
   "sources": [
    "wfrv",
    "wmtv",
    "cbs58",
    "gazette"
   ]
  },
  {
