    "wfrv",
    "wmtv",
    "wkow"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "K_lb",
   "type": "established",
   "nature": "fact",
   "text": "June 2024: LAPD Harbor Area detectives recovered more than 2,800 boxes of LEGO at a Long Beach home; a man was arrested on suspicion of organized retail theft and a woman on suspicion of grand theft. Narration: 'Near Los Angeles: 2,800 boxes. One house.' Counter 2,800.",
